/** @mainpage
 *  <h2>ABOUT</h2>
 *  <p>Simple alarm detecting vibrations from sensor(can be changed for any type of sensor).
 *     Uses SMS to comunicate with set up mobile number. 
 *     After init waits for initSMS in format: +123456789012 - 0000  (number - password)
 *     and accepts comands only from given "number" and deactivates alarm only by given "password"
 *     </p>
 *  <h2>LIBRARIES</h2>
 *  <p>using AltSoftSerial and TinyGPS libraries
 *  zip files included in folder ./libraries</p>
 *  <a href="https://github.com/PaulStoffregen/AltSoftSerial">AltSoftSerial</a> 
 *  <a href="https://github.com/mikalhart/TinyGPSPlus/releases">TinyGPS++</a>  
 *
 *  <h2>PIN LAYOUT</h2>
 *  <table>
 *  <tr>
 *   <th>Arduino</th>
 *   <th>Periferies</th>
 *  </tr> 
 *  <tr>
 *    <td>RELAY=6</td>
 *    <td>RELAY COM</td>
 *  </tr>
 *  <tr>
 *    <td>PWR=7</td>
 *    <td>MODULE PWR_KEY</td>
 *  </tr>
 *  <tr>
 *    <td>RX=8</td>
 *    <td>MODULE TX</td>
 *  </tr>
 *  <tr>
 *    <td>TX=9</td>
 *    <td>MODULE RX</td>
 *  </tr>
 *  </table>
 *  <h2>UI</h2>
 *  <h3>Commands</h3>
 *  <ul>
 *    <li>#GPS - show gps coords</li>
 *    <li>#ALARM - turn alarm on</li>
 *    <li>password - turn alarm off</li>
 *  </ul> 
 *  <h2>I/O</h2>
 *  <ul>
 *    <li>if fatal error happens during init, builtin led turns on</li>
 *    <li>if init is correct, builtin led blinks 10 times</li>
 *    <li>comunicates only with given number</li>
 *    <li>comunicates only trough SMS</li>
 *  </ul>  
 *  
 *  <h2>MODULE LIMITATIONS</h2>
 *    <p>during init is safer to watch module built in LED to check correct turn on<br>
 *    if no sms comes, send command again<br>
 *    comunication is set on 9600bauds, can be changed with AT+IPR=9600 (factory value is 115200 <- not safe to use) <br>
 *    module need 2A at peak <= needs to be plugged separatly, wont keeep many external chargers on by itself</p>
 */
